#. Key:	41596F554AC689A4223BC2A3BC17DDDD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/W_TelemetryDialogue.W_TelemetryDialogue_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock.Text
#: /Game/Widgets/W_TelemetryDialogue.W_TelemetryDialogue_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock.Text
msgctxt ",41596F554AC689A4223BC2A3BC17DDDD"
msgid "Budget Backrooms is now able to collect anonymized telemetry data of your in-game position on the levels you explore. This data is used to generate a heatmap of the most frequently walked areas or paths of the map.\r\n\r\nWhat the game sends:\r\n- Your SteamID to generate a hashed session token. Your SteamID is NOT stored anywhere. The session token cannot be traced back to you so you cannot be identified from the positions sent.\r\n- In-world position samples are sent every 60s.\r\n\r\nA new session token is generated when this option is enabled and at game startup.\r\n\r\nFor any concerns or questions, contact me at dabardev@dabar.dev or dabardibid@proton.me"
msgstr ""

