#. Key:	58AAFA3D462BA2DE0D8000A631328B81
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/W_GMSelect/W_GMSelect.W_GMSelect_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_20.Text
#: /Game/Widgets/W_GMSelect/W_GMSelect.W_GMSelect_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_20.Text
msgctxt "Game,58AAFA3D462BA2DE0D8000A631328B81"
msgid "Feeling fancy, innit? Welcome to Hardcore Mode. Quit? Rage? Alt+F4? Say goodbye to your save file, mate. No take-backs, no second chances—just you, the game, and the sweet sound of regret if you mess up. Buckle up since I will NOT make it easy for you.\r\n\r\nModifiers: (luckily I wrote this out)\r\n- Sanity does NOT regenerate. ('cause pessi machines are disabled duh)\r\n- Sanity drain rate is tripled (from 0,00025% to 0,00075% per ms)\r\n- Level 0's exit has now been relocated, and the map has been extended.\r\n- Savedata gets deleted upon game crash/exit/ALT+F4"
msgstr ""

